{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52958","headline":"授衣赋附歌 · 周存","name":"授衣赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愁霜落兮岁已终，秋雁吟兮悲远空。\n短褐不完兮忧思充，庭萧萧兮冷暮风。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一一三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}